        "value": "Mountaintops of the Giants treasure. 2 are found in a corpse hiding from a cliff behind an enemy. [ Map Link ]; Mountaintops of the Giants : 2 are found on a corpse at the edge of the cliffs behind and below Heretical Rise . [ Map Link ]; Castle Sol : 3x found on a corpse in an area between two buildings accessed via the wooden walkways in the courtyard. One more is found on a corpse hanging by a wall outside the Church. [ Map Link ]",
